<title>ITALY: Italian BTP Dec LIF future sets new record high.</title>
<headline>Italian BTP Dec LIF future sets new record high.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian BTP December futures contract on LIFFE set a new record high at 128.84 in late European trade.</p>
<p>The previous high of 128.70 was set on November 25. The contract expires on Wednesday December 4.</p>
<p>The contract was trading 1.05 points up on the day at 128.82 by 1545 GMT.</p>
